WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.227 line:68% position:50% align:center size:90%
一张海报画得很漂亮，

00:00:02.227 --> 00:00:03.786 line:68% position:50% align:center size:90%
但店名写错了。

00:00:03.786 --> 00:00:04.676 line:68% position:50% align:center size:90%
你觉得，

00:00:04.676 --> 00:00:07.794 line:68% position:50% align:center size:90%
这能算一次成功的图片生成吗？

00:00:07.794 --> 00:00:11.310 line:68% position:50% align:center size:90%
Qwen Image 要解决两个难题：

00:00:11.310 --> 00:00:12.975 line:68% position:50% align:center size:90%
在图片里写对文字，

00:00:12.975 --> 00:00:15.565 line:68% position:50% align:center size:90%
以及编辑局部时保留其他内容。

00:00:15.565 --> 00:00:16.300 line:68% position:50% align:center size:90%
首先，

00:00:16.300 --> 00:00:19.726 line:68% position:50% align:center size:90%
多模态语言模型读取文字指令。

00:00:19.726 --> 00:00:21.195 line:68% position:50% align:center size:90%
编辑图片时，

00:00:21.195 --> 00:00:23.153 line:68% position:50% align:center size:90%
它还会理解原图，

00:00:23.153 --> 00:00:24.866 line:68% position:50% align:center size:90%
形成语义条件。

00:00:24.866 --> 00:00:26.494 line:68% position:50% align:center size:90%
变分自编码器，

00:00:26.494 --> 00:00:28.121 line:68% position:50% align:center size:90%
简称 VAE，

00:00:28.121 --> 00:00:30.678 line:68% position:50% align:center size:90%
把图像压缩成潜在表示。

00:00:30.678 --> 00:00:31.375 line:68% position:50% align:center size:90%
最后，

00:00:31.375 --> 00:00:34.862 line:68% position:50% align:center size:90%
解码器再把潜在表示还原成像素。

00:00:34.862 --> 00:00:40.712 line:68% position:50% align:center size:90%
多模态扩散 Transformer 接收语义条件和图像表示，

00:00:40.712 --> 00:00:44.027 line:68% position:50% align:center size:90%
反复预测当前状态该往哪个方向变化。

00:00:44.027 --> 00:00:44.997 line:68% position:50% align:center size:90%
训练时，

00:00:44.997 --> 00:00:47.665 line:68% position:50% align:center size:90%
先把干净的图像潜在值，

00:00:47.665 --> 00:00:50.333 line:68% position:50% align:center size:90%
和随机噪声按时间混合。

00:00:50.333 --> 00:00:54.214 line:68% position:50% align:center size:90%
模型要学习从噪声走向图像的速度。

00:00:54.214 --> 00:00:56.089 line:68% position:50% align:center size:90%
假设干净值是二，

00:00:56.089 --> 00:00:57.495 line:68% position:50% align:center size:90%
噪声是负一，

00:00:57.495 --> 00:00:59.369 line:68% position:50% align:center size:90%
时间是零点二五。

00:00:59.369 --> 00:01:02.181 line:68% position:50% align:center size:90%
混合后的值是负零点二五，

00:01:02.181 --> 00:01:03.821 line:68% position:50% align:center size:90%
目标速度是三。

00:01:03.821 --> 00:01:06.568 line:68% position:50% align:center size:90%
如果模型预测速度二点五，

00:01:06.568 --> 00:01:09.086 line:68% position:50% align:center size:90%
平方误差就是零点二五。

00:01:09.086 --> 00:01:11.375 line:68% position:50% align:center size:90%
这里是一维教学算例，

00:01:11.375 --> 00:01:13.893 line:68% position:50% align:center size:90%
并非真实模型运行结果。

00:01:13.893 --> 00:01:17.004 line:68% position:50% align:center size:90%
生成时没有现成的目标图片。

00:01:17.004 --> 00:01:18.918 line:68% position:50% align:center size:90%
模型从噪声出发，

00:01:18.918 --> 00:01:21.072 line:68% position:50% align:center size:90%
反复预测更新方向，

00:01:21.072 --> 00:01:23.704 line:68% position:50% align:center size:90%
最终由解码器还原图像。

00:01:23.704 --> 00:01:25.079 line:68% position:50% align:center size:90%
修改原图时，

00:01:25.079 --> 00:01:27.599 line:68% position:50% align:center size:90%
语义路径理解要改什么，

00:01:27.599 --> 00:01:30.577 line:68% position:50% align:center size:90%
视觉编码路径提供原图细节。

00:01:30.577 --> 00:01:33.785 line:68% position:50% align:center size:90%
两路信息一起帮助编辑与保留。

00:01:33.785 --> 00:01:34.953 line:68% position:50% align:center size:90%
作者报告，

00:01:34.953 --> 00:01:37.523 line:68% position:50% align:center size:90%
中文常见字准确率较高，

00:01:37.523 --> 00:01:42.428 line:68% position:50% align:center size:90%
但第三等级生僻字准确率只有百分之六点四八。

00:01:42.428 --> 00:01:45.778 line:68% position:50% align:center size:90%
分数的小幅领先不等于统计显著。

00:01:45.778 --> 00:01:48.681 line:68% position:50% align:center size:90%
要判断双路设计各自的作用，

00:01:48.681 --> 00:01:52.254 line:68% position:50% align:center size:90%
还需要控制数据与算力做消融实验。

00:01:52.254 --> 00:01:53.446 line:68% position:50% align:center size:90%
回到海报：

00:01:53.446 --> 00:01:54.877 line:68% position:50% align:center size:90%
漂亮还不够。

00:01:54.877 --> 00:01:57.978 line:68% position:50% align:center size:90%
我们也要检查文字是否准确，

00:01:57.978 --> 00:02:00.125 line:68% position:50% align:center size:90%
修改是否符合要求，

00:02:00.125 --> 00:02:02.749 line:68% position:50% align:center size:90%
以及其他内容是否保留。

00:02:02.749 --> 00:02:03.910 line:68% position:50% align:center size:90%
记住四步：

00:02:03.910 --> 00:02:05.072 line:68% position:50% align:center size:90%
理解指令，

00:02:05.072 --> 00:02:06.233 line:68% position:50% align:center size:90%
表示图像，

00:02:06.233 --> 00:02:07.395 line:68% position:50% align:center size:90%
预测速度，

00:02:07.395 --> 00:02:08.556 line:68% position:50% align:center size:90%
解码结果。

00:02:08.556 --> 00:02:11.576 line:68% position:50% align:center size:90%
论文中的结果来自作者报告，

00:02:11.576 --> 00:02:13.899 line:68% position:50% align:center size:90%
动画数字是教学例子。
